 <h3><u>Had Hogai Hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Inhi se chali thi khuda ki khudai..(2)<br> Inhi par khudai ki had hogai hai</p> 
  <p>Do aalam me aale nabi he ke jin par<br> khuda aashnai ki had hogai hai</p> 
  <p>1. Kisi dam bhi sona nahi jisko bhata<br> use iska sona kucha aisa hai bhaya<br> mili iski marzi to sone ke badle<br> rizaye khuda leke jibreel aaya<br> nabi bhi bachaya..(2)<br> rizaye bhi leli<br> ali ki kamai ki had hogai hai</p> 
  <p><br> 2. Khuda o Ali jante hai woh manzil<br> bulaya tha Ahmed ko rabne jaha par<br> Chala farsh se sue arsh e bari par<br> ruka qafela teesre aasmaa par<br> kaha phir nabi ne jibreel jao<br> tumhari rasaai ki had hogai hai.</p> 
  <p>3. Khuda ne banaya hai aale nabi ko<br> inho ne khuda ki khudai bachai<br> agar tum meri baat se muttafiq ho<br> to phir mujhko ye baat kehne do bhai<br> udhar kibriyai ki had hogai<br> idhar na khudai ki had hogai hai</p> 
  <p>4. Hum aale mohd ke shia hai logo<br> batana hai humko ye apne amal se<br> magar hum ye afsos se dekhte hai<br> khushi ki mahafil ho ya gham ke mauke<br> kahi beridai ki had hogai hai<br> kahi khud numayi ki had hogai hai</p> 
  <p>5. Ohad ki ladai ho ya jung e khaibar<br> har ek ko safai se&nbsp; kata hai tune,<br> teri dastaras me jo aaya hai usko<br> barabar ke hisso me baata hai tune<br> Aye teghe Ali tere qurbaan jau<br> ke tujh par safai ki had hogai hai</p> 
  <p>6. Wo kaaghaz ke maidaa me lafzo ka lashkar<br> na laashe gire aur na kaate gaye sar<br> Faqat chand satro ki tehreer likh kar<br> kalam se ladai ye jeete hai shabbar<br> Kaha dekh kar&nbsp; zulfiqar e Ali ne<br> hasan par ladai ki had hogai hai</p> 
  <p>Inhi se chali thi khuda ki khudai<br> Inhi par khudai ki had hogai hai</p> 
